Pipeline modules live with the CLI under /app/deskbin and as sibling sources under /app. Spool bytes sit in /app/dropwell. Fixture copies sit at /app/seed/dropwell. Side listing helper is /app/dropwalk.
--- FORMAT ---
CLAT dump (little-endian):

  magic     4 bytes  "CLAT"
  version   u16
  write_stamp u32   dump-write unix seconds
  nstreams  u16
  then n directory entries: stype u32, rva u32, size u32

Stream type 3 (exception): dwLowDateTime u32, dwHighDateTime u32, code u32.
Those two dwords are a Windows FILETIME (100-nanosecond ticks; 10000000 ticks per second).
The FILETIME epoch is 1601-01-01, 11644473600 seconds before Unix epoch.

Stream type 15 (misc): 16-byte guid, then companion u8 (0 = primary, 1 = extra).

Digest on the keg is SHA-256 (sha256) of the dump file, written as lowercase hex.

Extra dumps added under the well, including names such as mid.clat, use this same layout.
Fixture copies of the well live at /app/seed/dropwell.
